<title>USA: Northland Cranberries Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Northland Cranberries Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WISCONSIN RAPIDS, Wis. 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>(DOLLARS IN THOUSANDS EXCEPT PER SHARE DATA)</p>
<p>		   For the 3 months ended  For the 6 months ended</p>
<p>		     February 28, 1997 and  February 28, 1997 and</p>
<p>			 February 29, 1996	  February 29, 1996</p>
<p>			    1997	 1996	  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenues	     $13,513    $ 3,980     $24,433    $25,684</p>
<p> Net income	     1,526	  149	 3,028	6,719</p>
<p>Net income per share(a):</p>
<p>			     0.11	 0.01	  0.21	 0.49</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  14,402,266 13,677,212  14,298,491 13,629,692</p>
<p>(a)  On September 2, 1996, the company effected a two-for-one stock split. Net income per share and weighted average shares outstanding shown for the periods ending February 29, 1996 are restated to reflect the stock split.</p>
<p>	  ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
